option.SHADOWS.comment=Disabling shadows also skips shadow geometry rendering.
option.AO_SAMPLES.comment=0 disables screen-space contact shading; vanilla AO remains.
option.WATER_DENSITY.comment=Depth controls absorption; lower density keeps deep water clearer.
option.WATER_SSR_STEPS.comment=Traces visible opaque geometry; off-screen hits fade to the sky. More steps cost more GPU time.
option.WATER_REFRACTION.comment=Distorts the opaque scene behind water and rejects foreground bank pixels.
profile.comment=Performance minimizes passes. Balanced targets everyday play. High adds water scene reflections. Ultra adds voxel light, volumetrics, soft shadows and cinematic effects.
option.BLOOM.comment=Uses two half-resolution passes; disabling skips both passes.
option.FXAA.comment=Spatial antialiasing; may slightly soften fine texture details.
